            "review_title": "Review at Yugen Bar",
            "review_text": "Chris T\n106 contributions\n0\nClassic cocktails in a calm, cool & convivial environment.\nJan 2024 • Couples\nYugen Bar HCMc is a popular bar located in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. The bar offers a wide selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks at reasonable prices. The atmosphere is lively and social, making it a great spot to meet friends or make new ones. The bartenders are friendly and knowledgeable, always happy to offer recommendations or special drinks. Overall, Yugen Bar HCMc is a great option for anyone looking for a fun and affordable night out in Ho Chi Minh City.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 17, 2024",
